WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.471
Emmy and Mom were planting flowers.

2
00:00:07.472 --> 00:00:12.955
"Sunday is a special day," said Mom.

3
00:00:12.956 --> 00:00:16.793
"I know," said Emmy.

4
00:00:16.794 --> 00:00:26.488
"We don't have to go to school!"

5
00:00:26.489 --> 00:00:31.755
Dad and Harry were watching TV.

6
00:00:31.756 --> 00:00:38.230
"Sunday will be a very fun day," said Mom.

7
00:00:38.231 --> 00:00:41.712
"Yes!" said Harry.

8
00:00:41.713 --> 00:00:54.591
"There's a great baseball game on TV!"

9
00:00:54.592 --> 00:01:02.287
Oliver and Rover were playing outside.

10
00:01:02.288 --> 00:01:07.500
Mom tossed the ball to Rover too.

11
00:01:07.501 --> 00:01:12.435
"Do you know what Sunday is?" she asked Oliver.

12
00:01:12.436 --> 00:01:15.798
"Yep," said Oliver proudly.

13
00:01:15.799 --> 00:01:27.758
"Sunday is the day after Saturday!"

14
00:01:27.759 --> 00:01:29.483
Poor Mom!

15
00:01:29.484 --> 00:01:32.837
Sunday was Mother's Day.

16
00:01:32.838 --> 00:01:41.596
But no one in the family remembered.

17
00:01:41.597 --> 00:01:48.528
On Sunday the kids woke up early.

18
00:01:48.529 --> 00:01:53.091
"Let's surprise Mom with breakfast," said Emmy.

19
00:01:53.092 --> 00:01:58.145
"She thinks we forgot about Mother's Day."

20
00:01:58.146 --> 00:02:04.397
Emmy and Dad made blueberry pancakes.

21
00:02:04.398 --> 00:02:07.743
Harry got the maple syrup.

22
00:02:07.744 --> 00:02:16.660
Oliver put some pretty flowers in a vase.

23
00:02:16.661 --> 00:02:22.119
Then they carried the tray upstairs.

24
00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:26.846
"Happy Mother's Day!" cried everyone.

25
00:02:26.847 --> 00:02:40.914
But Mom wasn't in her room!

26
00:02:40.915 --> 00:02:46.422
"I'm home!" called Mom.

27
00:02:46.423 --> 00:02:52.222
The kids and Dad ran downstairs.

28
00:02:52.223 --> 00:02:56.549
"Where were you?" asked Emmy.

29
00:02:56.550 --> 00:03:03.573
"I went out to buy some bagels," said Mom.

30
00:03:03.574 --> 00:03:07.281
"I wanted a special Mother's Day breakfast.

31
00:03:07.282 --> 00:03:09.738
And that is just what I got.

